{
  "$comment": "A legal frame bridge (D-MB5): inline Ground(world) -> 1-junction -> Mount.a(world). Inside Mount, an inline FixedTransform2D declares a: world and b: arm; Mount.b(arm) -> Arm.p(arm), and Arm's internal Body port is arm. Every bond joins equal named frames; only the transform changes frames, and the subsystem port frames match their internal attachments.",
  "format": "bgsim.model",
  "language": "0.1.0",
  "name": "PlanarFrameBridge",
  "diagram": {
    "nodes": [
